      "text": "Image Visualization of Different Methods Figure 5 presents a qualitative comparison of different\nmethods. Compared to baseline methods, ArenaPO consistently produces images with higher visual\nquality, better realism, and stronger alignment with human preferences. Please see Appendix D for\nmore results.\n",
