    {
      "block_id": "2605.06070_p8_b36",
      "text": "Image Visualization of Different Training Steps Figure 6 presents a qualitative comparison\nof different training steps. We observe that as training proceeds, the generated images exhibit\nprogressively more accurate semantic content and continuously improved visual quality, which\nverifies the effectiveness of the training process.\n",
